 ont été\n139:À noter, constructeur : Nerorrix.\n142:À l'arrivée, l'équipement était jugé non conforme.\n143:Prochaine visite préventive : 02.02.27.\n159:Technicien responsable : Laure Prigent\n160:Approbation client : Thomas Joly\n########## 032\n8:TECHNICAL INTERVENTION REPORT\n13:Installation : Line 4, diaphragm metering pump\n14:Equipment : —\n15:Manufacturer : Ulvrel\n16:Serial number : UL744512\n20:Adjustments were made with the machine stopped, then checked in production. The\n26:The prevention plan was reviewed with the site safety department before work\n36:connectors tightened. The previous preventive visit only involved cleaning the\n43:Guide lubrication was topped up as per the manual. The manufacturer's\n44:documentation was available on site and up to date.\n100:—\n106:—\n126:Serial\n141:Nominal volume\n178:On arrival the equipment was rated non-compliant.\n185:Technician's opinion\n210:ORYEQUIN SERVICES LTD | inspected,kept | 496.08E | UL-747-K | head gasket | ordered (not fitted) | 573.11 | UL-335-D | diaphragm | 636.79 | UL-775-D | suction valve | VI.CONCLUSION | Customer approval: Erin Calloway | Lead technician:Sarah Whitfield | Approvedon:March 29,2025 | sheet4/4 | Printed on April 8,2025 | ReportOS-RI-2025-1694\n########## 058\n12:MANUFACTURER\n13:—\n16:SERIAL NUMBER\n17:—\n20:SITE\n77:Dorionis Metrology | Documentref.DM-RI-2025-7410 RevisionB | 1.Visit | FIELDTEAM | REQUESTEDBY | TIMES | James Ainsley (assistant) | DeclanKerrigan | Arrival:8h00 | Duration:2h | Instrument | Make | Serial | Calibrated | VARINNET MOTOR | TYPEM72-4P | reference pressure | Varinnet | IN-50684 | 23/07/2025 | NM2326706 | gauge | 0.55kW2890min-1 | reference flowmeter | Lumulvan | EQ-16298 | 30/04/2025 | 230/400V50HzIP55 | Drive motorrating plate. | Background and equipment | Adjustmentsweremade with themachine stopped,then checked inproduction.Thevisit concerns the dosing equipment of line2.lt | is drivenbyaVarinnetmotor,typeM72-4P.Framefixings andhoseswerevisually ins