{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1795129655-tZ3VcYOGJZn0NVvw6X2E","role":"assistant","created":1795129659,"content":[{"type":"toolRequest","id":"chatcmpl-tool-93dc94946d392999","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"cd /travail && echo \"== 034 ==\"; sed -n '1,70p' work/textes/doc-034.txt; echo \"... OCR:\"; grep -n \"IMAGE\" work/textes/doc-034.txt; echo \"== ANSWERS ==\"; cat fourni/reponses/doc-034.json; echo \"== 016 serial\"; grep -n -i -E \"NE-2024|plaque|reads|indique|série\" work/textes/doc-016.txt; echo \"== 058 nominal\"; grep -n -i -E \"nominal|consigne|target|set point|1 ml|1,0 ml|1 mL\" work/textes/doc-058.txt; echo \"== 032 site\"; sed -n '1,30p' work/textes/doc-032.txt; echo \"== 032 answer\"; cat fourni/reponses/doc-032.json"}}},"_meta":{"goose.toolCall.providerIndex":0,"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true,"inference":{"provider":"openai","requestedModel":"deepseek-v4.1-flash"},"operations":{"llm":{"advertised_tools":["analyze","apps__create_app","apps__delete_app","apps__iterate_app","apps__list_apps","delegate","edit","extensionmanager__list_resources","extensionmanager__manage_extensions","extensionmanager__read_resource","extensionmanager__search_available_extensions","load","load_skill","read_image","shell","tree","write"]}}}}}
{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_ba87bf43-7d34-4470-9261-dfb2b34bd8ca","role":"user","created":1795129659,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"chatcmpl-tool-93dc94946d392999","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"resultType":"complete","content":[{"type":"text","text":"== 034 ==\n\n\n===== PAGE 1 =====\nNEVEVEX CALIBRATION LTD  |  SERVICE REPORT\nRef. NC-RI-2025-5530\nPrinted on 24/08/2025\n1 / 3\nSERVICE REPORT\nInspection and maintenance\nReport reference :\nNC-RI-2025-5530\nSupersedes :\nNC-RI-2025-5439\nPO number :\nPO-452696\nJob no. :\nAFF-62752\nCustomer :\nLorquin Pharma, Head office: Tralee\nSite :\n—\nInstallation :\nLine 2, piston filler\nManufacturer :\nSerial number :\nNE-2020-55424\nAsset no. :\nINV-33453\nRequest date :\n12/08/2025\nIssue date :\n20/08/2025\nBackground and equipment\nFrame fixings and hoses were visually inspected; no corrosion was found. The visit concerns the dosing equipment of line 2. It is\ndriven by a Ostiovan motor, type M92-2P.\nCourse of the visit\nOperators reported short stoppages at shift start, with no alarm message. The service request was received on 12 August 2025.\nThe customer's head office is in Tralee.\nReadings\nParameter\nValue\nDose volume, as found, E1-E3\n4'610 ; 4'700 ; 4'640\nDose volume, as left, E1-E3\n— ; — ; —\nDose volume, mean as left\n—\nFlow rate, as found\n0.92\nFlow rate, as left\n0.97\nOperating pressure, as found\n52.21\nOperating pressure, as left\n63.82\nProduct temperature (°C)\n28.0\nRating\nValue\nNominal volume\n5'000 µL\nTolerance\n± 75 µL\nModel range (OEM)\n5 – 500 mL\nTank capacity\n20 L\nLine volume\n826 mL\nExpanded uncertainty (k = 2)\n... OCR:\n87:[IMAGE p1 #1 bbox=(437,59,557,98) texte OCR:]\n90:[IMAGE p1 #2 bbox=(415,144,510,175) texte OCR:]\n154:[IMAGE p2 #1 bbox=(40,56,462,311) texte OCR:]\n157:[IMAGE p2 #2 bbox=(34,335,209,403) texte OCR:]\n172:[IMAGE p3 #1 bbox=(40,89,150,123) texte OCR:]\n175:[IMAGE p3 #2 bbox=(304,101,414,135) texte OCR:]\n== ANSWERS ==\n{\n  \"machine\": \"Corvex 160\",\n  \"constructeur\": \"Nevvex\",\n  \"numero_serie\": \"NE-2020-55424\",\n  \"site\": null,\n  \"reference_rapport\": \"NC-RI-2025-5530\",\n  \"date_intervention\": \"2025-08-15\",\n  \"date_validation\": \"2025-08-23\",\n  \"volume_dose_ml\": 5.1,\n  \"volume_nominal_ml\": 5.0,\n  \"tolerance_ml\": 0.075,\n  \"debit_ml_min\": 970.0,\n  \"pression_bar\": 4.4002,\n  \"reference_piece\": \"NE-146-R\",\n  \"technicien\": \"Erin Pryce\",\n  \"statut\": \"non_conforme\"\n}\n== 016 serial\n21:N° de série :\n35:dosage de la ligne 3, dont la plaque porte le numéro NE-2024-76883. Elle est entraînée par un moteur Lumulvan de type M66-2P.\n97:Plaque du moteur d'entraînement.\n100:N° série\n== 058 nominal\n132:231 mL\n165:Tank | Pump head | Line: 231 mL | 2 | Capacity: 60 L\n== 032 site\n\n\n===== PAGE 1 =====\nORYEQUIN SERVICES LTD\nPrinted on April 8, 2025\nsheet 1/4\nReport OS-RI-2025-1694\nTECHNICAL INTERVENTION REPORT\nReport reference : OS-RI-2025-1694\nPO number : PO-399338\nJob no. : AFF-24084\nCustomer : Solgen Foods, Head office: Doncaster\nInstallation : Line 4, diaphragm metering pump\nEquipment : —\nManufacturer : Ulvrel\nSerial number : UL744512\nAsset no. : INV-43735\nRequest date : March 13, 2025\nIssue date : March 23, 2025\nAdjustments were made with the machine stopped, then checked in production. The\nelectrical cabinet ventilation was dusted and its filter checked. Products\ndosed on this line are aqueous and of low viscosity; no hazardous product was\nin the circuit during the visit.\nI. BACKGROUND\nBackground and equipment\nThe prevention plan was reviewed with the site safety department before work\nstarted. PLC settings were not changed during the visit. The customer was\nbriefed on the points of attention noted during the visit. The visit concerns\nthe diaphragm metering pump Zenasol 40. It is driven by a Ostiovan motor, type\nL97-4P. The work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. The\n== 032 answer\n{\n