{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_8980c475-c2ec-4a74-88d5-071b1b60d13e","role":"user","created":1795129667,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf3056ca552703c9","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"resultType":"complete","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===== PAGE 4 =====\nDorionis Metrology\nDocument ref. DM-RI-2025-7410  Revision B\nPrinted on 06/10/2025\nPage 4/5\n3. Layout diagram\nKey: 1 tank; 2 supply line; 3 dosing unit; 4 pressure gauge; 5 flow direction; 6 outlet nozzle.\nTechnician's opinion\nNo abnormal noise or heating was observed during dry runs. At the end of the tests, the equipment may return to production without\nrestriction.\n\n\n[IMAGE p4 #1 bbox=(58,78,538,368) texte OCR:]\nTank | Pump head | Line: 231 mL | 2 | Capacity: 60 L\n\n\n===== PAGE 5 =====\nDorionis Metrology\nDocument ref. DM-RI-2025-7410  Revision B\nPrinted on 06/10/2025\nPage 5/5\n4. Parts\nPart no.\nDescription\nAction\nUnit price\nUL-373-K\ndiaphragm\ninspected, kept\n128.04 €\nUL-958-R\nhead gasket\nordered (not fitted)\n149.76 €\nUL-775-R\nsuction valve\nquoted\n146.18 €\nNo part was replaced during this visit.\n5. Observations\nNote, manufacturer: Ulvrel.\nAdditional information, flow rate as left: 22.98 L/h.\nFor the record, serial number: UL790154.\nThe upstream conveyor Ulvinnis C65 (flow 39.48 L/h, pressure 13.1 bar) is outside the scope of this visit; the workshop air network\nruns at 8.0 bar.\nReport prepared by James Ainsley.\nOn arrival the equipment was rated non-compliant.\nNext preventive visit: 18/03/2026.\nApproval workflow\nThe work area was cordoned off for the whole duration of the visit. The maintenance history was reviewed in the customer's\nlogbook. The report was reviewed on 19 September 2025.\n6. Signatures\nTechnician:\nCustomer approval: Sarah Thornley\n\n\n[IMAGE p5 #1 bbox=(36,403,146,437) texte OCR:]\n3 | UK>\n\n[IMAGE p5 #2 bbox=(298,415,408,449) texte OCR:]\n>> | 2","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":